	SG_ Climate_Airflow_Direction   : 28|4@1+ (1,0) [0|15] "" Vector__XXX
	SG_ Climate_Recirculation_State : 34|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1]  "" Vector__XXX

CM_ BO_ 795 "Climate_Status (0x31B): fan speed, airflow direction, recirculation.";
