	SG_ Driver_Temp_Raw    : 24|8@1+ (0.5,14) [14|32] "C" Vector__XXX
	SG_ Passenger_Temp_Raw : 32|8@1+ (0.5,14) [14|32] "C" Vector__XXX
	SG_ Rear_Temp_1_Raw    : 40|8@1+ (0.5,14) [14|32] "C" Vector__XXX
	SG_ Rear_Temp_2_Raw    : 48|8@1+ (0.5,14) [14|32] "C" Vector__XXX

CM_ BO_ 896 "Climate_Temperature (0x380): bytes 3-6 = temps (factor 0.5, offset 14, 0=Off). Bytes 0-2 look like a rolling counter (per Ioniq 5 observation; EV6 dumps consistent).";

