BO_ 1090 Sunroof_Status: 8 Vector__XXX
	SG_ Sunroof_Glass_State : 48|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" Vector__XXX
	SG_ Sunroof_Cover_State : 56|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" Vector__XXX

CM_ BO_ 1090 "Sunroof_Status (0x442): observed D6/D7 pairs: 30 30=Cover Closed; 30 50=Cover Moving; 30 60=Cover Opened; 10 60=Glass Closed/Transition (also logged as Glass Tilting); 50 60=Glass Sliding; 60 60=Glass Opened; 10 50=Glass Closing; 00 60=Glass Tilted/Windbreak. Byte roles inferred: D6=glass values, D7=cover values.";
CM_ SG_ 1090 Sunroof_Glass_State "byte 6 (D6): 0x00=Tilted/Windbreak, 0x10=Closed/Closing/Tilting/Transition, 0x30=Retracted (observed with cover closed, 0x30/0x30 pair), 0x50=Sliding, 0x60=Opened";
CM_ SG_ 1090 Sunroof_Cover_State "byte 7 (D7): 0x30=Closed, 0x50=Moving?, 0x60=Opened";
VAL_ 1090 Sunroof_Glass_State 0 "Tilted_Windbreak" 16 "Closed_Transition" 48 "Retracted" 80 "Sliding" 96 "Opened" ;
VAL_ 1090 Sunroof_Cover_State 48 "Closed" 80 "Moving" 96 "Opened" ;

