	SG_ DC_Charge_Limit : 40|8@1+ (0.5,0) [0|100] "%" Vector__XXX

CM_ BO_ 1221 "Charge_Limit_Control (0x4C5): D5 (byte 4) = AC limit, D6 (byte 5) = DC limit. Raw codes 0x64/0x78/0x8C/0xA0/0xB4/0xC8 = 50/60/70/80/90/100% (factor 0.5).";
